Only 1/34 spellbooks are generated blessed, so I really don't think
there is a good chance that a priest will find a blessed spellbook
before minetown.  And so many of the spellbooks aren't very useful in
the early game, that I honestly wouldn't use holy water on random
spellbooks, in hopes that it will be a spell that will increase your
chances of making it to minetown.

For example, I think it's so easy for rangers and monks to reach
minetown, that I ditch my starting pet on level 1, and only get the
pet when I need to BUC ID something.  I obviously don't see a need for
either of those classes to be able to read every spellbook they find
before they reach minetown.

